<title>USA: Xircom names chief operating officer.</title>
<headline>Xircom names chief operating officer.</headline>
<dateline>THOUSAND OAKS, Calif. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Xircom Inc said on Wednesday it had named Carl Russo to executive vice president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Russo previously served as executive vice president and general manager for Xircom since 1995. In his new role, Russo continues to report directly to the chief executive officer, and will be responsible for worldwide sales &amp; marketing, product development and operations.</p>
<p>Company officials were unavailable to say whom Russo replaced.</p>
